{"id":1586,"name":"Kono Minikuku mo Utsukushii Sekai","slug":"kono_minikuku_mo_utsukushii_sekai","synopsis":"High school student Takeru Takemoto works part time as a (motor)bike courier. During one of his deliveries, he saw a mysterious light passing him and fell into a forest. What he had found was a beautiful girl coming out from a glowing cocoon, calling herself \"Hikari.\" While Takeru was quite embarrassed because of Hikari's nudity, a strange monster suddenly showed up and immediately attacked the two. Both Takeru and Hikari demonstrated the power of their other selves before Takeru had a clue of what's going on.\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)","format":"TV","season":"SPRING","year":2004,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:44:06","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 04:26:23","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":146},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":146},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":124},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":1431},{"site":"ANN","externalId":2836},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":641},{"site":"HULU","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":3163,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/8Z8tViBJqt2Xx8OhJCEOBF9ddHDzlO9olvWLN9Hp.png"},{"id":3164,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/eBfqPLhbt0dCOUsUH6xT5gQmUKne2wLmAvwFLGVV.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":11,"name":"Shaft","slug":"shaft"},{"id":22,"name":"Gainax","slug":"gainax"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":2002,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":2002,"title":"Metamorphose","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":2229,"version":1,"episodes":null,"nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":917,"basename":"Konomini-OP1.webm","filename":"Konomini-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/Konomini-OP1.webm","mimetype":"video/webm","size":28997934,"resolution":720,"nc":true,"subbed":false,"lyrics":false,"overlap":"NONE","source":"BD","tags":"NCBD","audio":{"id":901,"basename":"Konomini-OP1.ogg","filename":"Konomini-OP1","link":"https://a.animeth